{"id":69038,"date":"2025-10-13T09:12:39","date_gmt":"2025-10-13T08:12:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69038"},"modified":"2026-10-01T23:48:05","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T22:48:05","slug":"corrida-das-lezirias","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-das-lezirias\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida das Lez\u00edrias 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida das Lez\u00edrias 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida das Lez\u00edrias 2027<\/strong> (32\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>27 e 28 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, tendo como epicentro o <strong>Parque Urbano do Cevadeiro<\/strong>, em <strong>Vila Franca de Xira<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Esta m\u00edtica e hist\u00f3rica competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva re\u00fane anualmente milhares de atletas e entusiastas do atletismo de todo o pa\u00eds num ambiente \u00edmpar de supera\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica e conv\u00edvio popular.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa oficial contempla a consagrada <strong>Corrida das Lez\u00edrias de 15 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s 10h00 de domingo, atravessando a emblem\u00e1tica Ponte Marechal Carmona rumo ao circuito pelas paisagens da Lez\u00edria em piso misto de asfalto, cal\u00e7ada e terra batida) e a <strong>Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s 10h15). Na tarde de s\u00e1bado, dia 27, realizam-se a <strong>Corridinha jovem<\/strong> (16h00, dos 400 m aos 800 m) e a concorrida <strong>Caminhada Noturna de 5 km<\/strong> (18h00).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Franca de Xira<\/strong> (Divis\u00e3o de Desporto), com o apoio t\u00e9cnico e log\u00edstico da <strong>Xistarca<\/strong>. Os participantes contam com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, postos de abastecimento aos 5 km e 10 km, apoio m\u00e9dico de emerg\u00eancia, bengaleiro e a tradicional medalha exclusiva de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; 